[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: SharpUnits capability requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Base SI dimensions
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Base SI dimensions within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented bounded JavaDimensionAdapter with exact rational dimensions, signed roots and nullable decomposition; native dimensions unchanged. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-002
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Product and quotient units
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Product and quotient units within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented immutable JavaUnit normalized products and quotients with preserved atom identity; native algebra remains available. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-003
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Rational powers/roots
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Rational powers/roots within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented signed powers/roots in the Java graph; pinned unsupported fractional-root converter access is explicit. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-004
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Dimensional equality and compatibility
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Dimensional equality and compatibility within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented separate structural unit equality, converter equivalence and exact dimension checks; CLR API identity is distinct. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-005
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Named derived and alternate units
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Named derived and alternate units within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented all 44 pinned catalog parent graphs, named alternates and metadata, with independent Java observations. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

