COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented exact radix/factor metadata and core affine prefix order; native SI prefixes retain exact factors and their affine safety guard. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

