STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Linear converters within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented exact-number linear conversion, operation reduction, immutable steps and explicit binary projection. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-009
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Affine converters
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Affine converters within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented ordered affine graphs and exact-number absolute/relative quantity semantics; native temperature policies remain separate. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-010
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Converter composition/inverse
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Converter composition/inverse within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented Java right-then-left Concatenate, native-order Then, exact inverse and normalized operation equality. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-011
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Nonlinear converters
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Nonlinear converters within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented bounded finite logarithmic/exponential converter graphs; nonlinear affine projection and unsupported domains are rejected. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-012
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Quantity conversion to compatible units
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Quantity conversion to compatible units within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented JavaNumberQuantity exact conversion, including relative constant-derivative conversion; legacy finite-double projection remains explicit. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-013
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Unit parsing
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Unit parsing within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Partial: Java path supports superscripts/double-star/colon roots, integer factors and single SI prefixes with pinned association; legacy parser unchanged; full grammar incomplete. Historical scope and evidence: docs/java-parity-gap-analysis.md; assertion-level implementation and verification evidence: conformance/tck-closure-ledger.json. This record is not a closure claim.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-015
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Unit and quantity formatting
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Unit and quantity formatting within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Partial: retained-value double text, mutable default labels/aliases, appendable unit output and bounded SIMPLE ASCII catalog/prefix profiles; general normalization, Java unit/API identity, arbitrary Number precision and EBNF/LOCAL remain incomplete. Historical scope and evidence: docs/java-parity-gap-analysis.md; assertion-level implementation and verification evidence: conformance/tck-closure-ledger.json. This record is not a closure claim.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-016
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Precision strategies
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Precision strategies within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented finite Integer/Rational/Decimal/Binary64 core with decimal128 promotion and documented pinned Java quirks; CLR integer widths are not Java runtime classes. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: JP-017
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Quantity arithmetic and comparison
STATEMENT: SharpUnits shall provide Quantity arithmetic and comparison within a documented compatibility envelope.
COMMENT: Inventory disposition: Implemented precision-preserving arithmetic, comparison, equality, scale handling and lazy inverse unit construction in JavaNumberQuantity; legacy double adapter exposes ToExact and InverseExact. Evidence: docs/work-package-one.md, conformance/work-package-one-assertion-audit.json and conformance/work-package-one-cases.json. Source requirements remain active; GitHub CI is disabled and no formal TCK closure is claimed.

